# Cactarantula: "This spell costs {1} less to cast if you control a Desert" (CR 601.2f): with a Forest instead of a Desert Bot1's five mana (the
# Forest's {G}, Mox Emerald's {G}, Black Lotus's {G}{G}{G}) is one short of {4}{G}{G}, so the cast is not offered; the same mana still pays for Grizzly Bears.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Cactarantula
Grizzly Bears
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
! Bot1.Hand.Cactarantula.Cast(Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Emerald; Grizzly Bears
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
